From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Satoshi Ikeuchi <satosan.ikm@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574: add the ath11k resource node

Describe the IPQ9574-family WLAN register window and named interrupts
observed on the Linksys LN6001. Connect the AHB device to the WCSS
remote processor using the upstream ath11k binding.

Keep the node disabled for board-specific enablement. The interrupt
list has no watchdog entry and includes transmit-completion ring 4,
so it must use the separate IPQ9574 binding rather than the IPQ6018
interrupt layout.

Link: https://lists.infradead.org/pipermail/ath11k/2026-January/008112.html
Signed-off-by: Satoshi Ikeuchi <satosan.ikm@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
@@ -963,6 +963,117 @@
 			};
 		};
 
